  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c2f2cb45dc8f5e9b",
      "translationZh": "我一直在尝试 MiniMax H3，终于在 TensorSharp 中实现了视频生成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "81e5c065a374c4c3",
      "translationZh": "TensorSharp 最初主要是一个本地 GGUF/LLM 推理引擎，因此，让视频生成流水线也能在同一个运行时中运行，是一次有趣的方向转变。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f7c15b57446516c2",
      "translationZh": "附上的演示是图生视频：先提供一张图像作为上下文，再给出描述动作/场景的提示词，H3 便通过 TensorSharp 在本地生成相应的视频。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "088a394411718c4b",
      "translationZh": "这里最让我感兴趣的其实不是 UI，而是让 LLM、多模态、图像，以及现在的视频推理汇聚到同一个本地推理引擎中，而不是每个模型系列都需要一套完全独立的 Python 技术栈。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5295f76e299a5137",
      "translationZh": "仍有不少地方需要优化。与自回归 LLM 相比，视频模型给内存管理、张量调度、注意力机制和模型卸载带来的压力很不一样。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3d3c0b70abbc9631",
      "translationZh": "我很好奇，大家接下来会优先改进 H3 推理的哪些方面：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "db1afff22c8db880",
      "translationZh": "更好的量化模型支持",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8078f2c7688f2f92",
      "translationZh": "参考素材/视频转视频工作流",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9ed39562eba4c36d",
      "translationZh": "如果有人想看看具体实现，仓库在这里：",
